23	 * conflicting background statement clears in milliseconds), while still
24	 * tolerating ONLY `42P01` and re-throwing every other error and the final
25	 * deadlock. These tests drive the helper with a scripted fake `postgres.Sql`
26	 * so they're deterministic and need no real database.
27	 */
