            `${TRUNCATE_LOCK_TIMEOUT_MS}ms x ${TRUNCATE_LOCK_RETRIES + 1} attempts. ` +
            `A session is holding a conflicting lock — most often a background ` +
            `poller started by an earlier test and never stopped.\n  ${blockers}`
