Worth restating #2817's distinction so this doesn't get re-wired to the flag that was deleted: \`uniquePerOrg\` was **cardinality** (does this value name one entity or many — \`email_domain\` is many). This is **scope** (does this value mean the same thing across connections). They come apart cleanly, and \`email_domain\` is many-per-org but globally meaningful, so scoping it per connection would be backwards." 2>&1 | tail -1

